{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 45,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 343.961,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now it came to pass that the people of Nephi were exceedingly rejoiced,",
      "verse": "45:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.196,
      "end": 9.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because the Lord had again delivered them out of the hands of their enemies;",
      "verse": "45:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.113,
      "end": 13.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they gave thanks unto the Lord their God;",
      "verse": "45:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.358,
      "end": 16.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they did fast much and pray much,",
      "verse": "45:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 16.232,
      "end": 19.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did worship God with exceedingly great joy.",
      "verse": "45:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.07,
      "end": 26.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the nineteenth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "45:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.659,
      "end": 29.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Alma came unto his son Helaman and said unto him:",
      "verse": "45:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.136,
      "end": 33.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou the words which I spake unto thee",
      "verse": "45:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.335,
      "end": 36.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning those records which have been kept?",
      "verse": "45:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.801,
      "end": 38.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Helaman said unto him:",
      "verse": "45:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.071,
      "end": 40.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe.",
      "verse": "45:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.144,
      "end": 42.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma said again:",
      "verse": "45:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.996,
      "end": 45.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou in Jesus Christ, who shall come?",
      "verse": "45:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.462,
      "end": 47.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "45:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.942,
      "end": 51.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe all the words which thou hast spoken.",
      "verse": "45:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 51.78,
      "end": 53.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma said unto him again:",
      "verse": "45:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.864,
      "end": 55.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Will ye keep my commandments?",
      "verse": "45:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.309,
      "end": 57.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "45:7",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 57.789,
      "end": 60.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I will keep thy commandments with all my heart.",
      "verse": "45:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.673,
      "end": 63.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then Alma said unto him:",
      "verse": "45:8",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 63.618,
      "end": 65.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed art thou;",
      "verse": "45:8",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 65.47,
      "end": 68.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord shall prosper thee in this land.",
      "verse": "45:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 68.936,
      "end": 72.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I have somewhat to prophesy unto thee;",
      "verse": "45:9",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.692,
      "end": 75.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but what I prophesy unto thee ye shall not make known;",
      "verse": "45:9",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 76.076,
      "end": 79.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, what I prophesy unto thee shall not be made known,",
      "verse": "45:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 79.507,
      "end": 81.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until the prophecy is fulfilled;",
      "verse": "45:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 82.055,
      "end": 84.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore write the words which I shall say.",
      "verse": "45:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 85.336,
      "end": 87.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the words:",
      "verse": "45:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 87.327,
      "end": 93.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I perceive that this very people, the Nephites, according to the spirit of revelation which is in me,",
      "verse": "45:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 93.776,
      "end": 100.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in four hundred years from the time that Jesus Christ shall manifest himself unto them, shall dwindle in unbelief.",
      "verse": "45:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 101.654,
      "end": 105.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and then shall they see wars and pestilences,",
      "verse": "45:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.224,
      "end": 107.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, famines and bloodshed,",
      "verse": "45:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 107.447,
      "end": 110.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until the people of Nephi shall become extinct\u2014",
      "verse": "45:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 111.331,
      "end": 114.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and this because they shall dwindle in unbelief",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 114.669,
      "end": 117.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fall into the works of darkness,",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 117.357,
      "end": 118.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lasciviousness,",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 119.116,
      "end": 122.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of iniquities; yea, I say unto you",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 122.825,
      "end": 126.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that because they shall sin against so great light and knowledge,",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 127.138,
      "end": 129.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I say unto you, that from that day,",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 129.779,
      "end": 133.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even the fourth generation shall not all pass away",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 133.349,
      "end": 135.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before this great iniquity shall come.",
      "verse": "45:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 136.258,
      "end": 138.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when that great day cometh,",
      "verse": "45:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.388,
      "end": 141.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the time very soon cometh that those who are now,",
      "verse": "45:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 142.144,
      "end": 146.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the seed of those who are now numbered among the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "45:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 146.829,
      "end": 150.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall no more be numbered among the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "45:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 150.76,
      "end": 152.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But whosoever remaineth,",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 152.798,
      "end": 156.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is not destroyed in that great and dreadful day,",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 156.182,
      "end": 158.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be numbered among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 158.87,
      "end": 161.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall become like unto them,",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 161.326,
      "end": 165.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all, save it be a few who shall be called the disciples of the Lord;",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 166.011,
      "end": 168.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and them shall the Lamanites pursue",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 168.699,
      "end": 171.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until they shall become extinct.",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 171.247,
      "end": 175.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, because of iniquity, this prophecy shall be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "45:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 175.828,
      "end": 183.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after Alma had said these things to Helaman, he blessed him, and also his other sons;",
      "verse": "45:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 183.299,
      "end": 186.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also blessed the earth for the righteous' sake.",
      "verse": "45:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 186.998,
      "end": 188.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 188.478,
      "end": 190.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus saith the Lord God\u2014",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 190.376,
      "end": 197.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cursed shall be the land, yea, this land, unto every nation, kindred, tongue, and people,",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 197.383,
      "end": 200.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto destruction, which do wickedly,",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 200.349,
      "end": 202.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they are fully ripe;",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 202.387,
      "end": 204.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as I have said so shall it be;",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 205.075,
      "end": 208.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for this is the cursing and the blessing of God upon the land,",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 209.063,
      "end": 213.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord cannot look upon sin with the least degree of allowance.",
      "verse": "45:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 213.737,
      "end": 217.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when Alma had said these words he blessed the church,",
      "verse": "45:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 217.214,
      "end": 221.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all those who should stand fast in the faith from that time henceforth.",
      "verse": "45:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 222.584,
      "end": 229.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when Alma had done this he departed out of the land of Zarahemla, as if to go into the land of Melek.",
      "verse": "45:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 229.451,
      "end": 233.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he was never heard of more;",
      "verse": "45:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 233.253,
      "end": 235.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as to his death or burial we know not of.",
      "verse": "45:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.534,
      "end": 240.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, this we know, that he was a righteous man;",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 240.243,
      "end": 242.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the saying went abroad in the church",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 242.977,
      "end": 245.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he was taken up by the Spirit,",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 245.433,
      "end": 248.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or buried by the hand of the Lord, even as Moses.",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 248.864,
      "end": 253.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the scriptures saith the Lord took Moses unto himself;",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 253.595,
      "end": 258.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we suppose that he has also received Alma in the spirit, unto himself;",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 258.651,
      "end": 263.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, for this cause we know nothing concerning his death and burial.",
      "verse": "45:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 263.882,
      "end": 271.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass in the commencement of the nineteenth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "45:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 271.214,
      "end": 276.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Helaman went forth among the people to declare the word unto them.",
      "verse": "45:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 276.956,
      "end": 280.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, because of their wars with the Lamanites",
      "verse": "45:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 280.387,
      "end": 286.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the many little dissensions and disturbances which had been among the people,",
      "verse": "45:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 286.279,
      "end": 290.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it became expedient that the word of God should be declared among them,",
      "verse": "45:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 291.149,
      "end": 294.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and that a regulation should be made throughout the church.",
      "verse": "45:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 295.451,
      "end": 300.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, Helaman and his brethren went forth to establish the church again in all the land,",
      "verse": "45:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 300.832,
      "end": 303.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in every city throughout all the land",
      "verse": "45:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 303.752,
      "end": 306.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was possessed by the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "45:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 306.347,
      "end": 313.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did appoint priests and teachers throughout all the land, over all the churches.",
      "verse": "45:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 314.086,
      "end": 317.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after Helaman and his brethren",
      "verse": "45:23",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 317.61,
      "end": 320.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had appointed priests and teachers over the churches",
      "verse": "45:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 320.994,
      "end": 323.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there arose a dissension among them,",
      "verse": "45:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 324.007,
      "end": 328.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not give heed to the words of Helaman and his brethren;",
      "verse": "45:23",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 328.867,
      "end": 330.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they grew proud,",
      "verse": "45:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 330.44,
      "end": 335.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being lifted up in their hearts, because of their exceedingly great riches;",
      "verse": "45:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 335.264,
      "end": 338.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they grew rich in their own eyes,",
      "verse": "45:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 338.23,
      "end": 343.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and would not give heed to their words, to walk uprightly before God.",
      "verse": "45:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    }
  ]
}